{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a full-screen "destination hero slider" block. Build an exact static layout first.
    
    OVERALL
    - Full-bleed: width 100vw (break out of any page-width container with margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw)), height 100svh, min-height 640px, position relative, overflow hidden, background #111.
    - Scope all markup, CSS and JS to a wrapper with a unique id based on block.id, so multiple instances never clash. Use plain CSS and vanilla JS only, no libraries.
    - Accent colour setting (default #ECAB32). All text is white.
    
    LAYER 1 — BACKGROUND
    - The active slide's image covers the whole block (object-fit: cover).
    - Three overlays on top of it: (a) flat black at the "overlay opacity" setting (default 25%); (b) a left-to-right gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.40) to transparent at 55%, for text legibility; (c) a top gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.35) to transparent at 20%, so a transparent theme header stays readable.
    
    LAYER 2 — TOP AUTOPLAY BAR
    - A 3px bar pinned to the very top edge. The track is transparent and the fill uses the accent colour. Start the fill at 0% width (Part 2 animates it).
    
    LAYER 3 — LEFT CONTENT (active slide)
    Left padding 5vw. Absolutely positioned: the top sits at 35% of the section height, and the bottom of the button row lines up with the bottom edge of the cards (about 82% of the height). Stack, in order:
    1. A white dash, 20px × 3px, with 18px space below.
    2. The location eyebrow (e.g. "Switzerland Alps"): body font, clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 22px), weight 300, inside an overflow:hidden mask, with 14px space below.
    3. A two-line title. Put each line in its own span inside its own overflow:hidden mask (Part 2 needs this). Use the display font, UPPERCASE, tall condensed bold (default Oswald 700, font_picker handle oswald_n7), font-size clamp(52px, 7.2vw, 112px), line-height 1.02.
    4. A description: 14px, line-height 1.75, white at 75% opacity, max-width 390px, margin 18px 0 28px.
    5. A button row, gap 16px, vertically centred:
       - Bookmark: a 38px circle filled with the accent colour, holding a white 14px bookmark SVG. Clicking it toggles a "saved" state (icon filled or outlined), client-side only.
       - A "DISCOVER LOCATION" pill: 40px tall, padding 0 28px, transparent, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), radius 999px, 11px uppercase, letter-spacing .12em, weight 500. On hover: white background, dark text. It links to the slide's button link.
    
    LAYER 4 — CARD TRACK (upcoming slides)
    - Positioned left: 41% and top: 42%. It runs off the right edge and the last visible card is cut off by the screen edge. That is intended.
    - Show every slide except the active one, in order after it, looping. Active 1 → cards 2,3,4,5,6. Active 3 → cards 4,5,6,1,2.
    - Each card is a <button>: width clamp(170px, 14.6vw, 240px), aspect-ratio 13/20, gap 1.9vw, border-radius 10px, overflow hidden, box-shadow 0 22px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35). Image object-fit cover. Bottom overlay gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.65) to transparent at 55%.
    - Card text sits bottom-left with padding 0 16px 20px: a 12px × 2px white dash; the location at 12px, white 85%; the title on 2 lines, UPPERCASE display font, 21px, line-height 1.05.
    - On hover: translateY(-6px) and a deeper shadow, over 300ms.
    
    LAYER 5 — CONTROLS ROW
    - Vertical centre at 91% of the height. The left edge lines up with the first card (41%); the right edge is 4vw from the screen edge.
    - Prev and next arrows: 60px circles, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), transparent, thin white chevron SVGs, gap 12px. On hover: white border and background rgba(255,255,255,.1).
    - A progress line fills the space between the arrows and the counter (margin 0 24px): a 1px line in rgba(255,255,255,.35) with a 2px accent fill on top. Fill width = activeIndex ÷ totalSlides, so slide 1 = 0% and slide 2 = 16.7% when there are 6 slides.
    - A counter on the right showing two digits ("01"): display font, clamp(36px, 3.6vw, 56px), inside an overflow:hidden box one line tall.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;position:relative;width:100vw;height:100svh;min-height:640px;margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);overflow:hidden;background:#111;color:#fff;font-family:{{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} *{box-sizing:border-box}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-bg,#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-overlay{pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.35),transparent 20%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.4),transparent 55%),rgba(0,0,0,{{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }})}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-top{position:absolute;z-index:5;top:0;width:100%;height:3px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-top span{display:block;width:0;height:100%;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-data{display:none}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-content{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:5vw;top:35%;width:min(38vw,520px)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-dash{width:20px;height:3px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:18px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-mask{display:block;overflow:hidden}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-eyebrow{font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,22px);font-weight:300;margin:0 0 14px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title{font-family:{{ block.settings.display_font.family }},sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(52px,7.2vw,112px);line-height:1.02;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.035em}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title span{display:block}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-description{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);max-width:390px;margin:18px 0 28px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-save{width:38px;height:38px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;padding:0}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-save svg{width:14px;height:14px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-link{height:40px;padding:0 28px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.55);border-radius:999px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-link:hover{background:#fff;color:#111}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-cards{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:41%;top:42%;display:flex;gap:1.9vw}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card{position:relative;flex:0 0 clamp(170px,14.6vw,240px);aspect-ratio:13/20;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;color:#fff;text-align:left;box-shadow:0 22px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s;background:#222}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 28px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.55)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,.65),transparent 55%)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-copy{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:16px;right:12px;bottom:20px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-dash{display:block;width:12px;height:2px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:9px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-location{display:block;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);margin-bottom:6px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-title{display:block;font-family:{{ block.settings.display_font.family }},sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls{position:absolute;z-index:4;left:41%;right:4vw;top:91%;transform:translateY(-50%);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow{flex:0 0 60px;width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.55);background:transparent;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow:hover{border-color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow svg{width:20px;height:20px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress{height:1px;position:relative;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35);flex:1;margin:0 12px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress span{position:absolute;left:0;top:-.5px;height:2px;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};width:0}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-counter{overflow:hidden;line-height:1;height:1em;font-family:{{ block.settings.display_font.family }},sans-serif;font-size:clamp(36px,3.6vw,56px);min-width:2ch;text-align:right}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} :focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:749px){#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-content{left:6vw;top:24%;width:86vw}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title{font-size:clamp(48px,14vw,76px)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-cards{left:6vw;top:auto;bottom:14%;gap:12px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card{flex-basis:150px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls{left:6vw;right:6vw;top:auto;bottom:3%;transform:none}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow{flex-basis:46px;width:46px;height:46px}}
{% endstyle %}
<destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} id="destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="dh-data">{% for i in (1..6) %}{% assign ik = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_image' %}{% assign lk = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_location' %}{% assign ak = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_one' %}{% assign bk = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_two' %}{% assign dk = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_description' %}{% assign uk = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_link' %}<div class="dh-slide" data-location="{{ block.settings[lk] | escape }}" data-one="{{ block.settings[ak] | escape }}" data-two="{{ block.settings[bk] | escape }}" data-desc="{{ block.settings[dk] | escape }}" data-url="{{ block.settings[uk] }}" data-img="{% if block.settings[ik] %}{{ block.settings[ik] | image_url: width: 2400 }}{% endif %}" data-alt="{% if block.settings[ik] %}{{ block.settings[ik].alt | escape }}{% endif %}"></div>{% endfor %}</div>
<div class="dh-bg"></div><div class="dh-overlay"></div><div class="dh-top"><span></span></div><div class="dh-content"><div class="dh-dash"></div><div class="dh-mask"><p class="dh-eyebrow"></p></div><h1 class="dh-title"><span class="dh-mask"><span class="dh-one"></span></span><span class="dh-mask"><span class="dh-two"></span></span></h1><p class="dh-description"></p><div class="dh-actions"><button class="dh-save" type="button" aria-label="Save destination" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 1.5h9v13L8 11.2l-4.5 3.3z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><a class="dh-link" href="#">Discover location</a></div></div><div class="dh-cards"></div><div class="dh-controls"><button class="dh-arrow dh-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous slide"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><button class="dh-arrow dh-next" type="button" aria-label="Next slide"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></button><div class="dh-progress"><span></span></div><div class="dh-counter" aria-live="polite">01</div></div>
</destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){const tag='destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class HeroSlider extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.items=Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('.dh-slide'));this.i=0;this.cards=this.querySelector('.dh-cards');this.querySelector('.dh-prev').addEventListener('click',()=>this.show(this.i-1));this.querySelector('.dh-next').addEventListener('click',()=>this.show(this.i+1));this.querySelector('.dh-save').addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.currentTarget,s=b.getAttribute('aria-pressed')!=='true';b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',s);b.querySelector('path').setAttribute('fill',s?'currentColor':'none')});this.show(0)}show(i){const n=this.items.length;if(!n)return;this.i=(i+n)%n;const a=this.items[this.i],bg=this.querySelector('.dh-bg');bg.replaceChildren();if(a.dataset.img){const im=document.createElement('img');im.src=a.dataset.img;im.alt=a.dataset.alt||'';bg.appendChild(im)}this.querySelector('.dh-eyebrow').textContent=a.dataset.location;this.querySelector('.dh-one').textContent=a.dataset.one;this.querySelector('.dh-two').textContent=a.dataset.two;this.querySelector('.dh-description').textContent=a.dataset.desc;this.querySelector('.dh-link').href=a.dataset.url||'#';this.cards.replaceChildren();for(let x=1;x<n;x++){const s=this.items[(this.i+x)%n],b=document.createElement('button');b.className='dh-card';b.type='button';b.setAttribute('aria-label','Show '+s.dataset.location);b.addEventListener('click',()=>this.show((this.i+x)%n));if(s.dataset.img){const im=document.createElement('img');im.src=s.dataset.img;im.alt=s.dataset.alt||'';im.loading='lazy';b.appendChild(im)}const c=document.createElement('span');c.className='dh-card-copy';c.innerHTML='<span class="dh-card-dash"></span><span class="dh-card-location"></span><span class="dh-card-title"></span>';c.querySelector('.dh-card-location').textContent=s.dataset.location;c.querySelector('.dh-card-title').textContent=s.dataset.one+' '+s.dataset.two;b.appendChild(c);this.cards.appendChild(b)}this.querySelector('.dh-counter').textContent=String(this.i+1).padStart(2,'0');this.querySelector('.dh-progress span').style.width=(this.i/n*100)+'%'}}customElements.define(tag,HeroSlider)})();</script>
{% schema %}{"name":"Destination hero slider","tag":null,"class":"destination-hero-block","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"color","id":"accent_color","label":"Accent color","default":"#ECAB32"},{"type":"range","id":"overlay_opacity","label":"Overlay opacity","min":0,"max":60,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":25},{"type":"font_picker","id":"display_font","label":"Display font","default":"oswald_n7"},{"type":"font_picker","id":"body_font","label":"Body font","default":"montserrat_n4"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 1"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_1_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_1_location","label":"Location","default":"Switzerland Alps"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_1_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"The Swiss"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_1_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"Alps"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_1_description","label":"Description","default":"Discover dramatic peaks, quiet valleys and unforgettable alpine escapes."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_1_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 2"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_2_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_2_location","label":"Location","default":"Amalfi Coast, Italy"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_2_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Coastal"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_2_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"Escape"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_2_description","label":"Description","default":"Winding coastal roads, vivid villages and Mediterranean views await."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_2_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 3"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_3_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_3_location","label":"Location","default":"Kyoto, Japan"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_3_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Quiet"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_3_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"Traditions"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_3_description","label":"Description","default":"Find stillness among historic streets, gardens and mountain temples."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_3_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 4"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_4_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_4_location","label":"Location","default":"Marrakech, Morocco"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_4_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Desert"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_4_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"Dreams"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_4_description","label":"Description","default":"A vivid journey through sunlit courtyards and the Atlas foothills."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_4_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 5"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_5_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_5_location","label":"Location","default":"Iceland Highlands"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_5_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Into the"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_5_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"Wild"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_5_description","label":"Description","default":"Explore vast volcanic landscapes, glacial rivers and open skies."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_5_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 6"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_6_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_6_location","label":"Location","default":"Patagonia, Chile"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_6_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Edge of the"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_6_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"World"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_6_description","label":"Description","default":"Follow the trail to remote peaks and the untamed southern frontier."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_6_link","label":"Button link"}],"presets":[{"name":"Destination hero slider"}]}{% endschema %}